Project Title
Pocket Smart AI – Smart Budget & Recommendation Assistant

## Testing Methods

### 1. Input Testing
Check whether the system accepts valid income and expense details.

### 2. Calculation Testing
Check total expenses, remaining balance, and budget calculations.

### 3. Category Testing
Check whether expenses are correctly classified into categories.

### 4. Budget Testing
Check the system when expenses are within and above the budget limit.

### 5. Recommendation Testing
Check whether the system provides suitable recommendations based on spending data.

### 6. Error Testing
Check invalid or empty inputs and ensure the system handles them correctly.

## Testing Result
The system is tested with different inputs to verify that the budget calculations, expense analysis, and recommendations work correctly.
